{"title":"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find one pair of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc42dc09a2c161aa30be74d70a220c6acf924c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4283272ce32f552d3d1df227fd4b0b808b33016f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)^7-a^7-b^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"19\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/0/0a00241b495a94bfc00453fb6d99d4123ace04e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^7$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>So we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0989009f433e65cb8b66470ea41d3194c81f7c4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\nmid ab(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7e5d4020af70f5e153449846f300687ac5f060.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^7 | (a+b)^7-a^7-b^7 = 7ab(a+b)(a^2+ab+b^2)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"378\" height=\"19\" />, so we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/893fb1e6838ef4978b7e5aaab4dcc53009303a20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3 | a^2+ab+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"19\" />.\nNow take e.g. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/2/fb22f0c86fd331c8feb0371b23e364fce4a076e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2,b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc8d26a22ce2e0fab4f62e8202e74ae171ef889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7|a^2+ab+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" />. Now by some standard methods like Hensels Lemma (used to the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61c97263b780d818c94885c3826b2e439657704e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> seen as constant from now) we get also some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84ed30abc3c509eb5712d25f95db533c618cbce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/63301ecf89a119c1585f0f964b5b20766a46334e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3 | \\overline{a}^2+\\overline{a}b+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/10719bf626fd529a3262e37fc37b7116bb3b546a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{a} \\equiv a \\equiv 2 \\mod 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc455e9abce5c22e966893b3f4c12af70adde92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\nmid \\overline{a}b(\\overline{a}+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> and we are done. (in this case it gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd7b558cc5248bd330b1bb83372a8bb54096fa55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{a}=325$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" />)\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by ZetaX. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p366644\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO\" title=\"1984 IMO\">1984 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174659\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 93/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 895/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3112/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.815      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    7.815      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20538:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017174659 and revision id 221121. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}